 {tag:'From our home to yours',title:'Happy<br>Navarathri!',text:'Thank you for sharing our LE’Golu celebration. May these nine nights bring courage, kindness, wisdom, and joy to every home.',lesson:'Stay a little longer. There is always another story to discover.',image:9}
